text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819AD9B {
    "Oh? You look like a good TRAINER.\nWill you look at my POKéMON?"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819ADDA {
    "I’m not good enough for you."
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819ADF7 {
    "I enjoyed our battle very much.\nPlease battle with me some other time."
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819AE3E {
    "Go!\nGo, our POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819AE53 {
    "Oh... We couldn’t win."
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819AE6A {
    "Did it surprise you that two POKéMON\nbattled at the same time?"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819AEA9 {
    "You can’t battle with us if you have\nonly one POKéMON.\lWhy? Because we’re strong!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819AEFB {
    "Hey, hey! This is my first battle in\na while. I’ll give it my all!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819AF3E {
    "But I gave it my all..."
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819AF56 {
    "You’re far too strong!\nYou must be a great TRAINER!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819AF8A {
    "My POKéMON are extremely cute and\nextremely strong.\lPlease allow me to show you."
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819AFDB {
    "I must concede defeat.\nAfter all, you are strong."
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B00D {
    "The next time we meet, I will have raised\nmy POKéMON much more.\pDon’t expect mercy then!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B066 {
    "We HIKERS are always full of energy!\nMy POKéMON are also full of energy, too.\lWe’re always itching for a battle!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B0D7 {
    "We ran out of energy..."
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B0EF {
    "Wahahah! Sure, we lost!\nBut we had a great battle, didn’t we?\lWe’re satisfied with that!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B148 {
    "You look like a strong TRAINER,\nbut can you beat us?"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B17D {
    "Waaah!\nWe lost!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B18D {
    "If two POKéMON can battle at the same\ntime, all sorts of new things can happen."
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B1DD {
    "Do you only have one POKéMON that can\nbattle?\pThen we can’t battle with you yet."
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B22E {
    "Have you tried beating all the other\nTRAINERS in battle?"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B267 {
    "Thanks for coming today!\pI hope you’re looking forward to this\ngame’s release!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B2B6 {
    "Huh? Did you battle with all the\nTRAINERS already?"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B2E9 {
    "Thank you for coming today!\pI hope you’re looking forward to this\ngame’s release!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B33B {
    "I’ve never seen the POKéMON you have.\nIt makes me envious a little."
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B37F {
    "Look at all those TRAINERS!\nThey have different POKéMON, too.\lAnd they’re all waiting for you!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B3DE {
    "Welcome to the World of POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_Route104_Prototype_Text_0819B3FF {
    "May all POKéMON battles be bright,\nfun, and ferocious!"
}
